CM_ "DBC expanded from the l77rodeo/GMLAN starter plus this repo's 2007 GM captures. Signals suffixed _observed are decoded from local CSV/video-task correlation; use comments for confidence and remaining validation needs.";
CM_ BO_ 201 "Repository-listed contents: Accelerator actual position; Accelerator actual position validity; Engine run active; Engine speed; Engine speed status; Platform engine speed command inhibit request; Power takeoff powertrain run aborted; Powertrain brake pedal discrete input; Powertrain brake pedal discrete input validity; Powertrain crank aborted; Powertrain crank active; Powertrain run aborted; Remote vehicle start engine running; Cylinder deactivation mode; Engine idle active; Driver throttle override detected; Cruise control enabled; Cruise control active status.";
CM_ BO_ 249 "Repository-listed contents: Transmission output shaft angular velocity; Transmission output shaft angular velocity sensor present; Transmission output shaft angular velocity validity; Transmission overall estimated torque ratio; Transmission overall estimated torque ratio validity.";
CM_ BO_ 499 "Repository-listed contents: Overdrive disable requested; Platform transmission tap up/tap down enable switch state; Platform transmission tap up/tap down switch state; Platform transmission tap up/tap down switch status rolling count; Transmission oil life reset request; Transmission platform shift pattern switches 1-4 active; Transmission platform shift pattern switch alive rolling count.";
CM_ BO_ 501 "Repository-listed contents: Automatic transmission commanded gear; Automatic transmission gear shift direction; Driver shift control request denied indicator on; Driver shift control target gear; Engine recommended upshift indicator on; Overdrive disable granted; Top of travel clutch switch active/validity; Transmission creep mode active; Transmission estimated gear/validity; Transmission range inhibit status; Transmission shift lever lock requested; Transmission shift lever position/validity; Transmission shift mode status; Transmission shift pattern active status; Transmission skip shift indicator on; Transmission tap up/tap down mode status.";
CM_ BO_ 481 "Repository-listed contents: Cruise control cancel request; Cruise control switch status; Cruise control switch status alive rolling count; Cruise control switch status protection value.";
CM_ BO_ 497 "Repository-listed contents: Display measurement system; Engine oil life reset request; Immobilizer pre-release password/status; Park brake switch active; Park brake virtual device availability; Power mode master accessory; Power mode master run/crank terminal status; PTO/remote-start master engine shutdown/start requests; Remote vehicle start request; System backup power mode/enabled; System power mode; Throttle progression request.";
CM_ BO_ 1257 "Repository-listed contents: A/C compressor type; Elapsed time count/reset; ABS present; Platform engine speed command system type; Traction control system present; Vehicle speed control system type; Vehicle stability enhancement system present.";

CM_ SG_ 201 EngineSpeed_observed "High confidence. Bytes D2-D3 big-endian scaled by 0.25 rpm: warm idle decodes about 580-660 rpm; rpm-500-inc reaches about 3200 rpm; WOT reaches about 5500 rpm.";
CM_ SG_ 201 AcceleratorPosition_observed "High confidence. D5 scales 0-100%; idle/brake/AC remain 0, normal accel peaks near 29%, throttle blips near 70%, WOT near 100%.";
CM_ SG_ 201 BrakePedalDiscrete_observed "Observed from brake-pedal timing. D6 is 0x40 when released and 0x41 near spoken Brake on events; bit0 is the brake-pedal discrete.";
CM_ SG_ 201 CruiseActive_observed "Inferred. D6 bit7 appears only during portions of cruise.csv where the drive task should have cruise active; confirm exact semantics from video.";
CM_ SG_ 409 TCMTorqueReq3_observed "Provisional but strong. Community layout for TCM->ECM torque request on 0x199; idle/brake inactive value is 1199.5 Nm with active=0, and Req3 drops/active=1 during upshift torque-management windows.";
CM_ SG_ 409 TCMTorqueReq3Active_observed "Provisional. Active bit rises during many 0x1F5 upshift target windows. Treat as the primary torque-reduction active flag for this capture set.";
CM_ SG_ 409 TCMTorqueReqRollingCounter_observed "Observed rolling counter cycles 0..3; U0101 diagnostics reportedly monitor rolling counts on 0x199/0x19D.";
CM_ SG_ 409 TCMTorqueReq4_observed "Provisional. Mostly inactive 625 Nm in these captures; appears during some manual downshift/rev-match style windows.";
CM_ SG_ 409 TCMTorqueReq4Protection_observed "Provisional protection/check value. Tracks counter/request as expected by community decode; do not transmit arbitrary values without generating protection correctly.";
CM_ SG_ 249 TransEstimatedTorqueRatioRaw_observed "Observed raw field. D1-D2 big-endian follows transmission gear/ratio state, not output speed: examples include 0x07AF in 1st/drive stationary, 0x00AA in 6th, 0x7CF0 in reverse, and 0x0000 in park/neutral.";
CM_ SG_ 249 TransOutputShaftSpeed_observed "High confidence. D4-D5 big-endian scales as 0.25 rpm/count for transmission output shaft speed. User observation: raw value near 6000 is about 40 mph, which is consistent with about 1500 rpm output speed before final drive/tire conversion.";
CM_ SG_ 501 CurrentGear_observed "High confidence. Low nibble of D1 is the current/achieved gear during drive captures. Example upshift sequence: 01 12 -> 02 12 -> 02 02.";
CM_ SG_ 501 CurrentGearShiftPhase_observed "Observed shift-phase nibble in high nibble of D1. 0=steady, 2 and 4 appear during in-progress shifts and likely mark shift/torque-management phases.";
CM_ SG_ 501 TargetGear_observed "High confidence. Low nibble of D2 is the target/next gear during shifts; equals current gear when stable.";
CM_ SG_ 501 TargetGearShiftDirection_observed "High confidence direction nibble in high nibble of D2. 0=steady, 1=upshift target, 2=downshift target.";
CM_ SG_ 501 ShiftLeverPosition_observed "High confidence selector/manual gear byte from PRNDL task: Park=1, Reverse=2, Neutral=3, Drive/M6=4, M5=5, M4=6, M3=7, M2=8, M1=9.";
CM_ SG_ 501 TapUpDownModeRaw_observed "Inferred. D3 is 0x10 during manual/tap mode sections and 0x00 in normal PRNDL/park captures.";
CM_ SG_ 501 DriverShiftControlRaw_observed "Inferred. D6 is 0x02 during manual/tap mode sections and 0x00 in normal PRNDL/park captures.";
CM_ SG_ 481 CruiseSwitchStatus_observed "Confirmed by user/video review. 0x00=cruise off, 0x40=cruise on/no buttons, 0x54=negative/set button down, 0x68=plus/resume button down, 0xC0=cancel button down.";
CM_ SG_ 481 CruiseSwitchProtection_observed "Protection/check byte. Verified against cruise_timeline and raw 0x1E1 frames: Protection = (-CruiseSwitchStatus - (D3 & 0x03)) & 0xFF. Examples released 0x40 gives C0/BF/BE/BD for counter 0/1/2/3.";
CM_ SG_ 481 CruiseSwitchAliveCounter_observed "Low two bits of D3. Cycles 0..3 and is included in the cruise switch protection formula. D3 is not a full 0..255 counter.";
CM_ SG_ 481 CruiseSwitchByte3Bit2_observed "D3 bit2. Set in key-on-key-off-cold and parts of cold-start when status is 0x00, producing D3 values 0x04..0x07. Not included in protection calculation.";
CM_ SG_ 497 SystemPowerModeRaw_observed "Raw observed power-mode byte. Mostly 0x10 run, with 0x11/0x12 seen during PRNDL/key-state transitions; exact enum needs key-state video review.";

VAL_ 501 ShiftLeverPosition_observed 1 "Park" 2 "Reverse" 3 "Neutral" 4 "Drive/M6" 5 "M5" 6 "M4" 7 "M3" 8 "M2" 9 "M1";
VAL_ 501 TargetGearShiftDirection_observed 0 "Steady" 1 "Upshift_Target" 2 "Downshift_Target";
VAL_ 501 CurrentGearShiftPhase_observed 0 "Steady" 2 "ShiftPhase_A_observed" 4 "ShiftPhase_B_observed";
VAL_ 481 CruiseSwitchStatus_observed 0 "Cruise_Off" 64 "Cruise_On_NoButtons" 84 "Negative_Set_Button" 104 "Plus_Resume_Button" 192 "Cancel_Button";
